{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"ebe769941c022d9149a3b60e4c421cd0af86f8d5b96f487928732c594b31d7cb","ja":"用意してきたこと","zh":"事先准备的内容","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"24c9c9443703ee69c94569a2d145147ce0d687c5c3aee80b45a2b8bcc9a9d097","ja":"可奈ちゃん、お疲れ様！\n後半はしっかりコツをつかめてたわね！","zh":"可奈，辛苦了！\n后半段你已经充分掌握诀窍了呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"62b5b60cb8bbb801bd4d878e2707fd0c2f44633c2c84ff26da04154efdbf2822","ja":"風花さん、ありがとうございました！\nおかげでいつもより、大人っぽい写真が撮れました～♪","zh":"风花小姐，非常感谢你！\n托你的福，拍出了比平时更有大人感觉的照片～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c642cbcbfb95c42639be993391ddce23979a85b6fc9e65ee48fe668a7bfad620","ja":"ふふ、どういたしまして。\n可奈ちゃんの力になれて、私も嬉しいわ。","zh":"呵呵，不客气。\n能帮上可奈的忙，我也很高兴哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1f629e221cb0dfe0c0b2fe62178ac1faffb02cc92d18d6a7891d828df26efbca","ja":"えへへ♪\n風花さんがいてくれて、本当によかったです♪","zh":"嘿嘿♪\n有风花在，真是太好了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4394a83ce945647cc2ae449e6a837314f9b1cf49b1f5277700d8271c865275e2","ja":"「それじゃあ次、豊川さん、お願いしまーす！」","zh":"“那么下一位，丰川小姐，拜托啦——！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"19b803a7d571364c64f6831a8265cefb6cabf1fd171990f24bafaf63fb2d5dc7","ja":"あっ、はい！　わかりました！","zh":"啊，好的！我知道了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7613779912251828dd4f2ac13867be686d056ca214598c4840d9f8474fc24764","ja":"（可奈ちゃんが終わって、ほっとしてたけど……。\n次は私の番。しっかりしなきゃ……）","zh":"（虽然可奈结束时，我松了一口气……\n但接下来就轮到我了。必须振作起来……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"cac6d9c45deeb53e38d8bc906bc5905468554b230cc682d81f3188460f90aae9","ja":"「さっきの矢吹さん、すごくよかったですから。\n豊川さんも、思い切りやっちゃってください！」","zh":"“刚才矢吹同学的表现非常棒呢。\n丰川小姐也请放开手脚，尽管去发挥吧！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"9062246e09305f36c61f8fe7bf8237404ea4c1cae0ca732897cca2f95a41aae9","ja":"は、はい！　よろしくお願いします！","zh":"好、好的！请多关照！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"268c72cc58baad869ea46cb1ab9f630da76b5e2e5182776dbad1e7981c43430e","ja":"（すごく期待されちゃってるみたい……。\nでも、この衣装に合わせて考えてきたポーズが……）","zh":"（大家好像对我非常期待……。\n可是，为了配合这套服装想好的姿势却……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"53bd7a80f89fabab152aaafadc03f9bdb602e574284daad6c80feaac0c09d4c3","ja":"（あ、このポーズ、さっき可奈ちゃんに教えたん\nだった！　やっぱり、同じはまずいわよね……）","zh":"（啊，这个姿势，我刚才教过可奈了！\n果然还是别做一样的比较好吧……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"1c684cb5ee9c004af1b0cdd5508fddb68b83f0a6323c3f4ebb20a00de31da72a","ja":"（じゃあ、別のを……あっ！\nこれも教えたんだった……。じゃ、じゃあ……）","zh":"（那么，换一个……啊！\n这个也已经教过了……那、那么……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"3101c04b04effaa21827b179d65b9e89489e067e4b1b5b9166bcdef7b2f78208","ja":"「……？　どうかしましたか、豊川さん？」","zh":"“……？怎么了吗，丰川小姐？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"613fb95db9fdaf416af7adebea46819583232d605248f42db88f31bc755ed937","ja":"い、いえ、別に……な、なんでもありません！","zh":"没、没什么……没、什么事也没有！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1b74272047431e402b133fff01fb91e8e370d8fc9a7740296982cc72bc6b3573","ja":"風花さ～ん！　頑張ってくださ～い！","zh":"风花姐～！要加油哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"6d7da05fa08c8a8f4d74307e99cef0d0d7efb00546a54a5127444aee6d345814","ja":"え、ええ、ありがとう。頑張るわね……。","zh":"嗯、嗯，谢谢你。我会加油的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1620.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"941934331484da3991d71f84f84007a7a9f450b4422bf9b6c7c847e242ad7b65","ja":"（ど、どうしよう～……？）","zh":"（该、该怎么办才好呢～……？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
